The legal text is the Constitution of the State of Washington (https://leg.wa.gov/state-laws-and-rules/washington-state-constitution/) and Title 9A of the Revised Code of Washington, as published by the Washington Office of the Code
Reviser (Statute Law Committee) at https://lawfilesext.leg.wa.gov/law/RCW/ and https://app.leg.wa.gov/rcw/ .

The sites' footer reads "Copyright. All Rights Reserved." for the site as a whole; no claim specific to the text of the RCW was
found. Statute text of a state is not copyrightable: Georgia v. Public.Resource.Org, Inc., 590 U.S. 255 (2020). Only statute text
is taken, not the history lines, notes or annotations. The text is republished here with credit to the Washington Office of the
Code Reviser as its publisher.

